### Monitoreo de planes de trabajo en un rango de fechas — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/monitoring
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "startDate": "2026-08-01T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-08-31T23:59:59"
}

### Monitoreo filtrado por organización/división/subdivisión — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/monitoring
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "startDate": "2026-08-01T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-08-31T23:59:59",
  "organizationId": 1,
  "divisionId": 1,
  "subdivisionId": 1
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/monitoring
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2026-08-01T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-08-31T23:59:59"
}

### Sin startDate/endDate (requeridos) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/monitoring
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "organizationId": 1
}

### endDate menor que startDate → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/monitoring
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "startDate": "2026-08-31T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-08-01T00:00:00"
}
